しているような感じを出したいです。\n可能であればループさせてください。\n \n2曲目は、少し寂しげで、でも明日の冒険に向けてワクワクするような曲にして欲しいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lost_Hometown/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1514962671170306048%2F_leR1wqk.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44491570aa7cabfcd8f3c4d1d839b236", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1514962671170306048%2F_leR1wqk.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44491570aa7cabfcd8f3c4d1d839b236, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1514962671170306048%2F_leR1wqk.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11edaa4a78984f963cda9c3ce54b7190 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1514962671170306048%2F_leR1wqk.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f9f0a4b39a0d0acb5f5ac82aec7b6cb 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your music is amazing! Can you please make a theme song for my OC?\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DNfpjcG5Tl1vbkPmtArRWRv6Pfd2K-ru?usp=sharing\n\nHis name is STEVE. He is a GPS AI from the future. He loves new places, cars, and talking to people. He's very curious about the world. There are a few problems with his programming which causes him to not be able to express many negative emotions... He wishes he could be more like a human. He doesn't actually have a physical body, he is just a hologram.\n\nThe song can be upbeat or relaxing! Something to listen to while traveling. Likely a nostalgic feeling... Maybe refreshing... It's up to you!\n\nHere is a playlist my friend made that could possibly help you! It's made especially for STEVE.  :)\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLZGYq5rCAkis7wMdJvYU-YwvuuGh-GiaX\n\nPlease, have 